{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54548","headline":"兵要望江南 占气第四（京本作「占气第二十三」○三十一首） 九 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占气第四（京本作「占气第二十三」○三十一首） 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"猛将气，黑色似龙形。\n或似（辛本、川本、京本作「类」）虎形（京本作「熊」）幷猛兽，当（京本作「形」）其敌上或城营，不可向前征。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54548.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54548","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}